{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you navigate the deadly course and secure a high score in this precision platformer / coin runner game? Invert gravity and jump to explore your way through a gauntlet of hazards collecting coins and big bonuses. Three modes of play available.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Undying</strong> - Explore 10 sections losing 1/3 score when you hit hazards. Greed your way through the course to earn a place on the leader board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merciless</strong> - An endless mode where hazards remove health. Get too greedy and your run is cut short. Difficulty also increases as you progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun</strong> - A 4-5 minute run where picking up coins speeds you up and jumping slows you slightly. Compete for the best time through the course.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/reward_choices.gif?t=1744066396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to fill the combo meter on the left. Once full take your choice of 3 rewards to enhance the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speed Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/speed_run.gif?t=1744066396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate faster and faster as you collect coins. Use gravity shift as often as possible because jumping will slow you down. Hitting hazards resets your speed entirely.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039650?t=1744066396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/e18b633a1c4b93ceff8108b07c22ee906dc02324/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744066396","capsu